{
  "name": "knowhow_answer",
  "description": "Answer a member's how, what, when or policy question from the team's pages (question: their words; source: teams, slack, email, web or app; place; channel_id or conversation_id; asker_name). Returns the page that answers, with the exact source line to say ('From Lead times, checked by Priya Raman on 3 Nov.') and a warning when it's past its check date. Logs the question; on a miss, names the topic's owner and how to ask them. Call it before searching other files; never invent what a page doesn't say.",
